{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "0b15b62edca4a947fc8222a35a893ec1882ee340e0591f026619b9277fc2abd8", "ja": "情熱のデスティネーション", "zh": "热情的Destination", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "81c94391f9af7e11bbfb84158f385b265482373499913004b2b9d5c3f7cf14f9", "ja": "ドラマ『階のスターエレメンツ』の主演に\n抜擢された未来、可奈、琴葉は、3人一緒の\n仕事ができることを喜び合う。演技が心配\nだと言う可奈に、未来は演技が得意な琴葉に\n教えてもらえば大丈夫だと言う。", "zh": "未来、可奈和琴叶被选为电视剧\n《阶梯上的Star Elements》的主角，\n三人都很开心能一同工作。\n可奈对自己的演技感到忧心，未来则说只要请\n擅长演戏的琴叶指导，一定就能克服困难。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9d84f629c63c51b0baa54f4339be7876731b5bdb324d2beb1817db1187c9fbd9", "ja": "（今日は『階のスターエレメンツ』出演メンバーの\n顔合わせだ。もうみんな集まっているようだが……）", "zh": "（今天是《阶梯上的Star Elements》演出成员\n的初次会面，大家似乎都已经到了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_01_1001_017kth", "source_sha256": "f97c1b7ae725dc525c8c995b0a649da07b44c44c36ce2528ff693eb3bc89e055", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}。\nもう、3人とも、そろってますよ。", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}。\n我们三个都到齐啰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_01_1002_014mir", "source_sha256": "4152fa103af2379ad65d2ede6dae588d194360c27ce38a34f3781f6b65cae944", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまでーす♪\n私たちに大事な話って、何ですか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦了～♪\n你说要通知我们重要的事，是什么事呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_01_1003_036kan", "source_sha256": "e72a67a9bc137da8978bc2b90b7d676b29a8609ab9170dddb54cb66e0fcce51f", "ja": "私に、未来ちゃんに、琴葉さん……。\nこの組み合わせって……も、もしかしてっ！？", "zh": "我和未来、琴叶……\n看这个阵容……该、该不会！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_01_1004_p", "source_sha256": "81059546e48ac2e0215043a31a2ff579708f6424ed8e382b1b89cc743604fdd4", "ja": "そのもしかしてだ。この前、3人に受けてもらった\n『階のスターエレメンツ』のオーディションだが……。", "zh": "你猜的没错，关于你们之前参加的\n《阶梯上的Star Elements》试镜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_01_1005_p", "source_sha256": "3c6ee22a372b63f2d9d05969dd84de45c9f543476895d30d4ba9f2f50f942ae9", "ja": "全員、合格が決まった！\n主演として、来月から早速、撮影開始だそうだ。", "zh": "你们三人都录取了！\n你们是演主角，所以听说下个月就要开始拍摄了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_01_1006_036kan", "source_sha256": "dee6726a2bf5427ff6afe2c01ea029884c925365e404913b6ce3ed5b029239dd", "ja": "ご、ごーかく……\n私たち、アイドル役に受かったんですかっ！？", "zh": "录、录取……\n我们录取了饰演偶像的角色吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_01_1007_014mir", "source_sha256": "70d0f7e46d59cc09120f85d164dca2bef6312cfa38dd2d5385af98feb442536e", "ja": "わぁ～！？　やったね、琴葉ちゃん、可奈！\n3人で、ドラマのお仕事ができるんだって！", "zh": "哇～！？太好了，琴叶、可奈！\n我们三人可以一起演电视剧耶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_01_1008_017kth", "source_sha256": "13db3b803840411f0f4664d7d10f81efc917096515f102ea6cfe82af6cbe18f3", "ja": "合格、しかも3人ともだなんて……。\nありがとうございます、{$P$}！", "zh": "不仅录取，而且还三个人一起上……\n谢谢你，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_01_1009_p", "source_sha256": "549eb5b5a31dc26231bfc02bf8a1bfbfa6904fb0193276f437cd817a442949c9", "ja": "いや、みんなが頑張った結果だよ。\n撮影は大変だと思うけど、しっかり頑張っていこう！", "zh": "不，这是你们努力的成果。\n虽然拍摄应该会很辛苦，但要好好加油喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_01_1010_036kan", "source_sha256": "75fbd3dae51f5c01c39a21be413c0508620d77f12e9501195b1946b372c2a994", "ja": "は～いっ！　3人でドラマ～♪\n違う自分になれる場～♪", "zh": "好～！三个人一起拍电视剧～♪\n能成为不一样的自己～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_01_1011_017kth", "source_sha256": "8b97ab964916b9bb25a07ae741e65578798a83c942284ca580ba928c489be9b2", "ja": "ふふっ。よろしくね、ふたりとも！\n{$P$}も、よろしくお願いします！", "zh": "呵呵，请两位多指教了！\n也要请{$P$}多多指教！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_01_1012_017kth", "source_sha256": "7f1d269bafb8f30a2a61d34e96084478b9588d5b4fd0b331882231023200a491", "ja": "私、オーディションのあと、今回のドラマの\n制作チームについて、調べてみたんです。", "zh": "之前试镜结束后，\n我有查过这次电视剧的制作团队。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_01_1013_017kth", "source_sha256": "7dbbc86782a86503a1870e91ca2b80fe13e80839f4905a601e626bf0ad147795", "ja": "私でも知っている有名な作品が、いくつもありました。\n現場は、厳しくて評判だとか……。", "zh": "他们制作过几部连我都知道的知名作品，\n拍摄现场以严格而闻名……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_01_1014_014mir", "source_sha256": "10dff2f4b80fa1406de53ec2d0aac7dfb5098cdb715dc7cf41685f2770232939", "ja": "ええっ、厳しいの！？", "zh": "什么！很严格吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_01_1015_p", "source_sha256": "b93a472c3d95efff2e9e97c1b77e1514b441b2e8858f343ca6345adc16db081b", "ja": "ああ。けどその分、作品には妥協がない。\n業界の中だけでなく、海外でも評価が高いそうだ。", "zh": "没错，但相对地，对作品也不会有丝毫妥协。\n不仅在业界受到好评，连国外的评价也相当高。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_01_1016_017kth", "source_sha256": "eb87c85413b051f62e4ba0dfd34d62f37abfff9365f24bc324bd60a9651c6c7b", "ja": "はい。……作品も見ましたが、心を打たれました。\nふさわしい演技ができるよう、私もがんばります！", "zh": "是的……我也有看他们的作品，觉得相当感动。\n我也会好好努力，发挥出符合他们期待的演技！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_01_1017_036kan", "source_sha256": "2c02b4315db8f1b7a78583fd63e62fbfb78e05159ab66476f25a72a2e6611699", "ja": "ホントに、そんなに怖い監督さんなんですか？　私、\n演技にあんまり自信ないですけど、大丈夫かな～……？", "zh": "导演真的那么可怕吗？\n我对演戏没什么信心，真的不要紧吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_01_1018_017kth", "source_sha256": "9c07f4454387743cac5a4d0b63b323fc46fb9da88780bdfd9d48c38f5d72899a", "ja": "心配しなくても、ちゃんとやれば大丈夫だよ。\n理由もなく叱られたりはしないと思うし……。", "zh": "不用担心，只要好好去演就好了，\n毕竟导演应该也不会无缘无故凶人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_01_1019_p", "source_sha256": "7c9678e94b1acb07ef338f16140e2d02bb0d3e8f6661e6a150d9e9fc6aa8c013", "ja": "うん。未来と可奈は、現場の雰囲気に飲まれず、\nのびのびしていたのが良かったのかもしれないしな。", "zh": "没错，况且试镜时未来和可奈没被现场气氛吓到，\n放松自在地演出，或许就是录取的原因。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_01_1020_036kan", "source_sha256": "dd52db3a7a890e5eb042f418397762b9ce002e3511a35803f11e3e38a939e492", "ja": "そうだったかな？　そうだった気がします！", "zh": "是这样吗？感觉好像是这样没错！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_01_1021_014mir", "source_sha256": "c58718aed929de68ed599ff09df52b282f62ee55b35d694a05db721c07200a37", "ja": "そうだった気がします！", "zh": "感觉好像是这样没错！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_01_1022_036kan", "source_sha256": "7e9a7a595f5f079a4802bded3c79f13636ca4e1426c1a48932569ccd7d2fa59e", "ja": "ええっ！？　未来ちゃん、緊張してなかったの？\n私は緊張したよ！　ご飯がのどを通らなくって……。", "zh": "咦咦！？未来你那时都不紧张吗？\n我很紧张耶！紧张到饭都吃不下了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_01_1023_014mir", "source_sha256": "0389d4e89aaf9fd9e9a723c4a1c2f482191faadcbc1269a498a4b1e2f399ab16", "ja": "そういえば……可奈、あのとき\nお弁当のからあげ、私にくれたよね！", "zh": "这么说来……可奈，\n你那时候把便当里的炸鸡块给我吃了对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_01_1024_036kan", "source_sha256": "381f2ff2fc8b3175f432f95cdf01f205bbc69a8e0940668a74eca81ba58d7d1f", "ja": "だって、食べられそうになかったから……\n未来ちゃんは、からあげ、全部食べてたよね。", "zh": "因为我感觉就吃不下……\n但你把炸鸡块都吃完了嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_01_1025_p", "source_sha256": "5a839c6386f5da079fd7a02fd69e003d986b7cf68a81f57115f9c6948f0d7474", "ja": "なんというか……さすがだな、未来。", "zh": "这该怎么说呢……真不愧是未来啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_01_1026_014mir", "source_sha256": "50d7f83bcd44af6911b7704c80691697842e9feeb9ea4ebcc5932c4c59eb0a79", "ja": "えへへ……それほどでも～♪", "zh": "嘿嘿……也没那么夸张啦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_01_1027_036kan", "source_sha256": "24a8da69c4a1ad5d0242220de1d2fbee73d05c7a990cafa045840286964cc9c0", "ja": "でも、未来ちゃんが、いつもどおりだったからかな？\n本番では私、あんまり緊張しなかった気がします！", "zh": "但应该是因为看到未来表现得跟平常一样的关系吧？\n总觉得我在正式试镜时也没那么紧张！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_01_1028_017kth", "source_sha256": "13daf0f6a0c9155f0638f675197489d31a6ec3a3ebb712913c83ebc6cab95ac2", "ja": "なら、可奈ちゃんがオーディションで\nのびのび歌えたのは、未来のおかげだったんだね。", "zh": "那可奈在试镜时能自在地唱歌，\n也可以说是未来的功劳呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_01_1029_014mir", "source_sha256": "5bdd80950051ac76b4897b9f2ac47c1dbd4c3d6d1778274c49215281d97b9d48", "ja": "そうなんだー！　{$P$}さん、\nいま私、ほめられましたよね！？", "zh": "这样啊──！{$P$}先生，\n我刚刚被夸奖了对吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_01_1030_p", "source_sha256": "c1c9c410a12703fe2a33443f043ec1bb0271945876280f66be6557b56505b645", "ja": "一応な！", "zh": "可以这么说！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_01_1031_017kth", "source_sha256": "d3c3eef14f2e148f2b44bcb2da3f9fd6b80046c36668939c2f58ac0093bbabf4", "ja": "未来ったら……ふふっ。", "zh": "未来你真是的……呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_01_1032_p", "source_sha256": "8caee8bd9143142dd241338dfd1215a09503e85df82abd5c8500ed7e12052c3d", "ja": "確かに、緊張しっぱなしで実力を出せないよりは\nいいかもな。……それじゃ、今から台本を配るぞ！", "zh": "这的确比紧张到无法展现实力好多了……\n那我要发剧本了喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_01_1033_p", "source_sha256": "8f4a5670400a8422cbe7d392bc4e422469e7cea0db2bdc5d3090f8992fb8ff44", "ja": "撮影開始までに、みんな、しっかり\nセリフを頭に入れてきてくれ、との事だ。", "zh": "制作团队交代，\n在拍摄开始前，各位要好好把台词背熟。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_01_1034_017kth", "source_sha256": "82fe645ca49f413c34e948a1da4745764491244a90191169962151368819aa29", "ja": "わかりました。……できれば本番前に、\n私たち3人で読み合わせもしておきたいですよね。", "zh": "我知道了……可以的话，\n希望我们三人也能在正式拍摄前先对过一次台词。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_01_1035_036kan", "source_sha256": "ce0d1901b44833f440213bfaca923d65c09ad66417cc771e609d840c17b073f2", "ja": "私の役って、すっごく裏表がある女の子なんですよね。\nううっ、難しそう……うまくできるか不安だな～？", "zh": "我要演的角色是非常表里不一的女生对吧？\n呜呜，感觉好难喔……好担心我能不能演好喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_01_1036_014mir", "source_sha256": "a707c7614e54ef51b7a8fa1670db0aee958a942d13ce0131812fb8e1ce8d3fe1", "ja": "心配しなくても大丈夫だよ、可奈！\nだって私たちには、琴葉ちゃんがいるんだもん♪", "zh": "不用担心喔，可奈！\n因为我们还有琴叶可以靠嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_01_1037_014mir", "source_sha256": "6b82ddcb0951be572feeb4e7bf1498bbad9005a4d8cbfb5b659d94b4494399b6", "ja": "琴葉ちゃん、お芝居すっごく上手だし。琴葉ちゃんに\n教えてもらえば、私たちも、きっとなんとかなるよ！", "zh": "琴叶的演技那么好，\n只要请她教我们，我们一定也能演好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_01_1038_017kth", "source_sha256": "7c0a8923cd8a302077aff50d4b377b29787cf2fa582b228eb1e471959cc97af3", "ja": "教えるのは構わないけど、演じるのは自分だからね？\nそれを忘れないように！", "zh": "教当然没问题，但还是要靠你们自己去诠释，\n可别忘了这点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_01_1039_014mir", "source_sha256": "7ec267ca6e8b152c17e49e49675f8aa25b6deca4b27c0913b48405739cc05fef", "ja": "はーいっ、がんばりまーす♪", "zh": "好──我会好好加油的──♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_01_1040_017kth", "source_sha256": "3c361cc415d342b85105cceb65e467cdfb5dc254922a274ba11b9fd89183889c", "ja": "さっそく、明日みんなで読み合わせしてみようか。\n{$P$}、構いませんか？", "zh": "那明天我们就先对一次台词看看吧。\n{$P$}，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_01_1041_p", "source_sha256": "07072d7971c98293b847f858a98afa9131f5477aa0ac1901cb588b97c1dbc9aa", "ja": "ああ、構わないよ。\nレッスンルームの予定をおさえておこう。", "zh": "当然没问题。\n那我先借好练习室吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_01_1042_036kan", "source_sha256": "baee7936c09cdaf83917c4df5c4ca0f956c080b301f2f082bf2aee23898aaa52", "ja": "3人で練習～♪\nがんばるぞ、シュッシュシュ～♪", "zh": "三个人练习～♪\n一起加油，咻咻咻～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_01_1043_p", "source_sha256": "9045743c38325838ccb01bb80e1405e0c7ca11e0c4498f7d1373b45302c63600", "ja": "それから……今回のドラマの魅力は、\nアイドル候補生達が切磋琢磨する姿だと思う。", "zh": "然后……我想这部电视剧最大的魅力，\n就是偶像候补生之间切磋琢磨的模样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_01_1044_p", "source_sha256": "202399f10430819b067f32a4658b0c6279eaca7b294799c03951cc47f4e4d138", "ja": "夢に向かう少女の、ひたむきな姿だ。……みんなも\nお互いを高め合えるよう、頑張ってみてほしい！", "zh": "也就是少女一心朝梦想前进的模样。\n希望你们也能互相激励，好好努力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_01_1045_014mir", "source_sha256": "8cc4400a1c8e46e0a729682dc8cb1009cfa2f564ff14a77f81195f6b7d0f9865", "ja": "まかせてください、{$P$}さん！\n私、がんばってセッセタクマしますっ♪", "zh": "交给我们吧，{$P$}先生！\n我会努力切缩琢磨♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_01_1046_014mir", "source_sha256": "30006d8aeccb7f7c81ffe7513d42ee5e9fcd4554c6f875c4272b8fc453cffa22", "ja": "あれ？　違いましたっけ？\nセッセ……セッソ？", "zh": "咦？是不是不太对？\n切缩……切戳？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_01_1047_p", "source_sha256": "996df701649b0c286102e55a5567d1ae93cecab5f138512842fb694e491b1d48", "ja": "（……ちょっと心配だが、気合いは十分なようだ。\n言葉の意味は、身をもって学んでもらおう！）", "zh": "（……虽然有点担心，但她们看起来都干劲十足。\n至于成语的意思，就透过实际体验来学习吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
